          "description": "One row per Epoch AI site: whether the Atlas of Data Center Politics lists the same site (channel atlas_dcp). status is found (ref gives the Atlas record_id, several separated by semicolons), not_found or not_checked. checked_by is script:dc_checks where an Atlas record has the same street address (in the United States the same house number, street and state) or no candidate was found, and human:V where V judged the candidates the script listed. Where V's verdict differs from the address rule, the address rule decides and note keeps V's verdict. search_method gives the rule."
        }
